### def disasm      -> String
### def disassemble -> String

self が表す命令シーケンスを人間が読める形式の文字列に変換して返します。

```ruby
puts RubyVM::InstructionSequence.compile('1 + 2').disasm
```

```text title="出力"
== disasm: <RubyVM::InstructionSequence:<compiled>@<compiled>>==========
0000 trace            1                                               (   1)
0002 putobject        1
0004 putobject        2
0006 opt_plus         <ic:1>
0008 leave
```

- **SEE** [m:RubyVM::InstructionSequence.disasm]

